  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: StructureDefinition xdmSubmissionSet</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder0\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"The logical name of the element\">Name</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Information about the use of the element\">Flags</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the element can appear in the instance\">Card.</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Reference to the type of the element\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Additional information about the element\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet\" title=\"Modèle logique d'un lot de soummission (SubmissionSet).\">xdmSubmissionSet</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://build.fhir.org/types.html#Base\">Base(4.0.1)</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">XDM SubmissionSet</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.entryUUID\" title=\"Identifiant unique du lot de soumission. Cet attribut est destiné à des fins de gestion interne alors que uniqueId est utilisé à des fins de référence externe.\">entryUUID</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.entryUUID\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#uuid\">uuid</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Identifiant unique du lot de soumission. Cet attribut est destiné à des fins de gestion interne alors que uniqueId est utilisé à des fins de référence externe.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.availabilityStatus\" title=\"Cette métadonnée représente la pertinence d'un lot de soumission.\">availabilityStatus</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.availabilityStatus\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Cette métadonnée représente la pertinence d'un lot de soumission.<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding: </span><a href=\"https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/terminologies/1.14.0/ValueSet-JDV-J52-AvailabilityStatus-CISIS.html\" title=\"https://mos.esante.gouv.fr/NOS/JDV_J52-AvailabilityStatus-CISIS/FHIR/JDV-J52-AvailabilityStatus-CISIS\" class=\"binding\">JDV_J52_AvailabilityStatus_CISIS (20200424120000)</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Example version à jour du lot de soumission: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceDarkGreen\">urn:oasis:names:tc:ebxml-regrep:StatusType:Approved</span><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Example version archivée du lot de soumission: </span><span class=\"xhtPieceDarkGreen\">urn:asip:ci-sis:2010:StatusType:Archived</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.submissionTime\" title=\"Représente la date et heure de soumission.\">submissionTime</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.submissionTime\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#dateTime\">dateTime</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Représente la date et heure de soumission.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.title\" title=\"Titre du lot de soumission\">title</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.title\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Titre du lot de soumission</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.comments\" title=\"Cette métadonnée contient le commentaire associé au lot de soumission.\">comments</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.comments\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Cette métadonnée contient le commentaire associé au lot de soumission.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.patientID\" title=\"Cette métadonnée contient l'identifiant du patient tel que connu par les interlocuteurs prenant part à l'échange. Le matricule INS (NIR ou NIA) du patient doit être utilisé en priorité. À défaut de disponibilité de l'INS, un autre identifiant (ex: IPP du système émetteur) peut être utilisé.\">patientID</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.patientID\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmPatientId.html\">xdmPatientId</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Cette métadonnée contient l'identifiant du patient tel que connu par les interlocuteurs prenant part à l'échange. Le matricule INS (NIR ou NIA) du patient doit être utilisé en priorité. À défaut de disponibilité de l'INS, un autre identifiant (ex: IPP du système émetteur) peut être utilisé.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.sourceID\" title=\"Cette métadonnée représente l’identifiant unique global du système émetteur du lot de soumission\">sourceID</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.sourceID\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#oid\">oid</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Cette métadonnée représente l’identifiant unique global du système émetteur du lot de soumission</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.uniqueID\" title=\"Identifiant unique global affecté à ce lot de soumission par son créateur. Cet attribut est utilisé à des fins de référence externe alors que entryUUID est destiné à des fins de gestion interne.\">uniqueID</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.uniqueID\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#oid\">oid</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Identifiant unique global affecté à ce lot de soumission par son créateur. Cet attribut est utilisé à des fins de référence externe alors que entryUUID est destiné à des fins de gestion interne.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.contentType\" title=\"Ensemble de métadonnées représentant le type d’activité associé à l’événement clinique ayant abouti à la constitution du lot de soumission.\">contentType</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.contentType\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmCode.html\">xdmCode</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Ensemble de métadonnées représentant le type d’activité associé à l’événement clinique ayant abouti à la constitution du lot de soumission.<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding: </span><a href=\"https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/terminologies/1.14.0/ValueSet-JDV-J03-XdsContentTypeCode-CISIS.html\" title=\"https://mos.esante.gouv.fr/NOS/JDV_J03-XdsContentTypeCode-CISIS/FHIR/JDV-J03-XdsContentTypeCode-CISIS\" class=\"binding\">JDV_J03_XdsContentTypeCode_CISIS (20260928120000)</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#preferred\" title=\"Instances are encouraged to draw from the specified codes for interoperability purposes but are not required to do so to be considered conformant.\" class=\"binding\">preferred</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.code\" title=\"Les valeurs possibles doivent être un code provenant du jeu de valeurs mis à disposition par le projet (exemple : JDV_J59_ContentTypeCode_DMP).#xA;  En l’absence de spécifications complémentaires, le jeu de valeurs JDV_J03_XdsContentTypeCode_CISIS peut être utilisé. \">@code</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.code\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">contentTypeCode correspondant au type d’activité associé à l’événement ayant abouti à la \nconstitution du lot de soumission.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.displayName\">@displayName</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.displayName\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#string\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Libellé associé au contentTypeCode.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-xdmSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.codingScheme\">@codingScheme</a><a name=\"en-xdmSubmissionSet.contentType.codingScheme\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#oid\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">oid</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">OID du système de codage associé au code contentTypeCode.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" t